        "cooked": "<p>Whew! Second time was the charm. I lost both Expat and Akash (you’re right, her incaps are worthless!), but Lifeline and Sky-Sky were all I needed to get the last Projection kill! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
