        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-11-17T21:38:09.456Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another weird wrinkle on this one is that the Squall-Guard is usually a friend to the heroes, but in this match he becomes a must-kill, since he hits the Dreamer twice while bouncing off the Advanced armor of her projections.  Sky threw him once, but it took me far too long to get around to it, in large part because I was saving the two Thorathian Monoliths for phase 2 (and then died after playing just one of them).</p>",
